Link: https://lore.kernel.org/bpf/20231011223728.3188086-4-andrii@kernel.org
Acked-by: Ricardo B. Marlière <rbm@suse.com>
[rbm: Pulled along with bpf-Disambiguate-SCALAR-register-state-output-in-ver.patch -- they belong to the same series]
